OL,3,ACatterick Garrison fire could burn
OL,4,Athrough night, authorities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters expect to work all night
OL,7,Fas a fire blazes at the military
OL,8,Fbarracks accommodation block in
OL,9,FCatterick Garrison, North Yorkshire.
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid in a statement that multiple crews
OL,13,Fwere at the scene, along with an
OL,14,Fappliance from County Durham and
OL,15,FDarlington.
OL,17,F"The incident is expected to be ongoing
OL,18,Fthroughout the night," the statement
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
